  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="c176dfb9-b663-5851-a12d-46e86ad5ae4f" activityNameId="18a86bc9-d23d-5571-bcd6-4d0ca6e14352" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Rape seed extensive, at farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Rape seed extensive, at farm
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg rape seed extensive, at farm with a moisture content of 6%. Fresh matter yield/ha at 6% moisture is 2683kg.;
Synonyms: canola, Brassica napus L.; 
UUID: 5f5d384f-b72a-3ef2-b0ca-cfa6241f61e6
The inventory includes the processes of soil cultivation, sowing, weed control, fertilisation, pest and pathogen control, harvest and drying of the grains. Machine infrastructure and a shed for machine sheltering is included. Inputs of fertilisers, pesticides and seed as well as their transports to the regional processing center (10km) are considered. The direct emissions on the field are also included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Integrated production with extensive plant protection (no fungicides, insecticides and growth regulators)
Time period: The yield data have been collected for the years 1996-2003.
Production volume: CH prod of rape seed: 59100t in 2004.
Sampling: Data were compiled from statistics, pilot network, fertilising recommendations, documents from extension services, information provided by retailers and expert knowledge. The production data were verified and adjusted by a group of experts. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f5d384f-b72a-3ef2-b0ca-cfa6241f61e6.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
